  speciesId: 1
  displayName: Sundial Cactus
  category: 0
  room: 1
  tier: 2
  isCrystal: 0
  difficulty: 2
  description: 'A squat, round cactus bristling with thin curling spines, crowned
    with a single small flower. The spines themselves seem to lean and gather toward
    whatever light is strongest at the time.


    Its needles count the sun rather
    than drink it, filling in stem by stem as the light grows and falling bare again
    as it fades.'
  descriptionSecondary: "Stays in its pot permanently and just reads its own light
    level, showing 0 to 4 stems depending on how much direct sun it's getting right
    now \u2014 a living light gauge, nothing more."
